      "text": "F \u2014 Lilac\n\nFrom the screen recording you sent.\n\nLavender ground, white cards, #6C4EE8 accent, black selected pill, Plus Jakarta Sans.\n\nSignatures: the ticked dial, date chips with progress rings, the widget grid with \u2197 buttons, triple-ring donut, striped bar chart with one solid selected bar.\n\nNumbers match the other directions (1,558 of 2,300) so the screens compare like for like."
